1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,280
Never eat this beetle.

2
00:00:01,659 --> 00:00:04,019
It shoots boiling hot spray out of its butt.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:09,240
Two chemicals mix inside it and explode, at 212 degrees Fahrenheit.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,240
Even if a toad swallows it, it keeps firing inside its stomach,

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,000
Until the toad throws it back up, alive.

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,539
So whatever you do,
